2025-10-08 12:27:46,801 [WARNING] Skipped idx=119: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: In humans, two TAp73 isoforms have been identified: full-length (TA) and N-terminally truncated (deltaN). The full-length TAp73 is covalently modified by NEDD8 under physiologic conditions in an Mdm2-dependent manner, which regulates its transactivation function. This modification leads to the cytoplasmic localization of TAp73, thereby inhibiting its ability to transactivate p53- and p73-responsive promoters. The deltaNp73 isoform, on the other hand, lacks this NEDD8 modification and remains in the nucleus, where it can inhibit the pro-apoptotic functions of TAp73 and p53. Thus, the presence of these two isoforms and their distinct post-translational modifications play a critical role in the regulation of apoptosis and tumorigenesis.'
